:: StoryTitle
My Wudlands Story


:: StoryData
{
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Start",
  "zoom": 1
}


:: StoryInit {"position":"25,25","size":"100,100"}
<!-- StoryInit sets up the story. -->
<!-- Players never see it. -->
<!-- Optional: one picture from your Images list -->
<!-- here becomes the story's cover. -->

<!-- ********* Required ********* -->
<!-- The title in the story list -->
<<set $meta_title to 'My Wudlands Story'>>
<!-- One or two spoiler-free sentences -->
<<set $meta_description to 'A short teaser for the story list.'>>
<!-- Your pen name -->
<<set $meta_author to 'Your pen name'>>
<!-- 1 to 5 genres from the genre list -->
<<set $meta_genres to ['adventure', 'island']>>
<!-- The largest party: 1 to 4 -->
<<set $meta_maxCharNum to 1>>
<!-- The level: 1 to 6 -->
<<set $meta_adventureTier to 1>>
<!-- Adventure weeks it costs: 1 to 4 -->
<<set $meta_durationWeeks to 1>>
<!-- free, trial or paid - one free story per author -->
<<set $meta_access to 'trial'>>

<!-- Every success and failure your scenes set: -->
<!-- "success" or "failure", then a group and a -->
<!-- name, or only a name, after colons. -->
<!-- Words, no sentences. -->
<<set $meta_endings to [
  "success",
  "failure",
  "failure:ran_away"
]>>
<!-- Fixed, leave it: Run away is allowed at the start -->
<<set $meta_allowRunAway to true>>

<!-- ***** Your own starting values ***** -->
<<set $gold to 0>>


:: Start {"position":"250,100","size":"100,100"}
<!-- The first scene. -->
<!-- Each link below leads to another scene. -->
Your story begins here.

[[Go on|Arrival]]
[[Give up|Lost]]


:: Arrival {"position":"400,50","size":"100,100"}
<!-- An ending: no links, and $isEnding says -->
<!-- how the run ended. A name may follow after -->
<!-- a colon, like "success:met_queen" - list it -->
<!-- in StoryInit too. -->
You arrive safely.
<<set $isEnding to "success">>


:: Lost {"position":"400,200","size":"100,100"}
You lose your way.
<<set $isEnding to "failure">>


:: Retreat {"position":"25,150","size":"100,100"}
<!-- Only the Run away button opens this scene: -->
<!-- no scene may link here. It may lead on to -->
<!-- more scenes; every ending of the Retreat -->
<!-- story is a failure. -->
You turn back.
<<set $isEnding to "failure:ran_away">>


:: LastResort {"position":"25,275","size":"100,100"}
<!-- The platform sends a run here when something -->
<!-- breaks, and the player gets the run back. -->
<!-- No links, and nothing links here. -->
The path ahead collapses. You return home empty-handed.
<<set $isEnding to "lastresort">>
